      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "UBI is the only viable solution because it acknowledges the fundamental shift in the job market, where automation and AI will displace human workers at an unprecedented rate. By providing a guaranteed basic income, UBI ensures that everyone has a safety net, regardless of their employment status, thereby reducing poverty, inequality, and social unrest. This, in turn, allows people to pursue meaningful work, retrain, and adapt to new industries, rather than simply existing in a precarious economic limbo. UBI also frees up governments from the burden of welfare programs, allowing them to invest in education, retraining, and innovation.",
